'''Marble''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting the [[Marble Egg]], the [[Bank Egg]] and the [[IDontHaveAUse Egg]] during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance ==
Its blade is white in color with a marble texture. The guard is silver and handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
* It has a [[Green Marble|green]] and [[Orange Marble|orange]] variant, but the guard for this one is silver rather than solid black.
*It is the third marble themed knife to have been released in the game.
*All the eggs needed to collect this knife are [[:Category:Uncommon|uncommon]] in rarity.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

